Package: supervisoR
Type: Package
Title: Pathway Enrichment Visualization
Version: 1.2.0
Author: person("Hans Adam Boegh", "Marstrand-Joergensen",
  email = "adamboegh@gmail.com",
  role = c("cre","aut"),
  comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-5917-3154"))
Maintainer: Hans Adam Boegh Marstrand-Joergensen <adamboegh@gmail.com>
Description: Visualize pathway enrichment scores on hierarchical pathway or ontology graphs.
  Supports publication-oriented static figures and interactive exploration via
  Shiny, with built-in helpers for Reactome and GO biological process hierarchies,
  compact multi-condition glyphs, and workflow helpers for custom hierarchies.
